        " \"يَبِيعُ وَ لاَ يُكَفِّرُ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4304 - It is narrated from Sa'd ibn al-Hasan, from Abu Abdillah (as), that Imam (as) was asked about a man who swears that he will not sell his merchandise for a certain price, but then later changes his mind.\nImam (as) said: \"He may sell it, and no expiation is required.\""
        ]
      }
